# Copy the component-specific example to backend/.env, voice-agent/.env, or web/.env.local.
# Backend: backend/.env.example
# Voice agent: voice-agent/.env.example
# Frontend: web/.env.example
# Booking lookup also needs matching AGENT_API_TOKEN (backend) and
# BACKEND_API_TOKEN (voice agent) values, plus separate per-property Mews
# API URL, ClientToken, and AccessToken values in backend/.env.
